# Stable spec ID: punch-siesta. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(tequila; blanco) 1 1/2 oz
(lime: juice, fresh) 3/4 oz
(juice, grapefruit) 1/2 oz
(simple syrup) 3/4 oz
(bitter aperitif @ Campari) 1/4 oz

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(coupe)

::instructions
<shake, measured ingredients with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<strain, into a chilled (coupe)>
<garnish, with a lime wheel>

